ar-heading">
General principles</th></tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content">
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delegated_legislation" title="Delegated legislation" class="mw-redirect">Delegated legislation</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exhaustion_of_remedies" title="Exhaustion of remedies">Exhaustion of remedies</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Justiciability" title="Justiciability">Justiciability</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ministerial_act" title="Ministerial act">Ministerial act</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ouster_clause" title="Ouster clause">Ouster clause</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rulemaking" title="Rulemaking">Rulemaking</a></li>
<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ultra_vires" title="Ultra vires">Ultra vires</a></i></li></ul></td>
</tr><tr><th class="sidebar-heading">
<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prerogative_writ" title="Prerogative writ">Prerogative writs</a></th></tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content">
<ul><li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Certiorari" title="Certiorari">Certiorari</a></i></li>
