<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mandamus" title="Mandamus">Mandamus</a></i>
<ul><li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peremptory_writ_of_mandamus" title="Peremptory writ of mandamus">Peremptory mandamus</a></i></li></ul></li>
<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Procedendo" title="Procedendo">Procedendo</a></i></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Writ_of_prohibition" title="Writ of prohibition">Prohibition</a></li>
<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quo_warranto" title="Quo warranto">Quo warranto</a></i></li></ul></td>
</tr><tr><th class="sidebar-heading">
Grounds for <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Judicial_review" title="Judicial review">judicial review</a></th></tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content">
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Legitimate_expectation" title="Legitimate expectation">Legitimate expectation</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nondelegation_doctrine" title="Nondelegation doctrine">Nondelegation doctrine</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Procedural_justice" title="Procedural justice">Procedural justice</a>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Natural_justice" title="Natural justice">Natural justice / Procedural fairness</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Due_process" title="Due process">Due process</a>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abuse_of_process" title="Abuse of process">Abuse</a></li></ul></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fundamental_justice" title="Fundamental justice">Fundamental justice</a></li></ul></li>
