<ul><li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wednesbury_unreasonableness" title="Wednesbury unreasonableness" class="mw-redirect">Wednesbury</a></i></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Patently_unreasonable" title="Patently unreasonable">Patent unreasonableness</a></li></ul></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fettering_of_discretion_in_Singapore_administrative_law" title="Fettering of discretion in Singapore administrative law">Fettering of discretion</a></li></ul></td>
</tr><tr><th class="sidebar-heading">
Merits review &amp; oversight</th></tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content">
