</tr><tr><th class="sidebar-heading">
Administrative law by jurisdiction</th></tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content">
<div style="margin-bottom: 2px; margin-top: 2px;"><i>Common law</i></div>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Australian_administrative_law" title="Australian administrative law">Australia</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canadian_administrative_law" title="Canadian administrative law">Canada</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Administrative_law_in_Singapore" title="Administrative law in Singapore">Singapore</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_African_administrative_law" title="South African administrative law">South Africa</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Kingdom_administrative_law" title="United Kingdom administrative law" class="mw-redirect">United Kingdom</a>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scots_administrative_law" title="Scots administrative law">Scotland</a></li></ul></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_administrative_law" title="United States administrative law">United States</a></li></ul>
