<li id="mwAQE"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Israeli_bombing_of_the_Gaza_Strip" title="Israeli bombing of the Gaza Strip" id="mwAQI">Israeli bombing of the Gaza Strip</a></li>
<li id="mwAQM"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Strict_scrutiny" title="Strict scrutiny" id="mwAQQ">Strict scrutiny</a></li>
<li id="mwAQU"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Budapest_Convention_on_Cybercrime" title="Budapest Convention on Cybercrime" id="mwAQY">Budapest Convention on Cybercrime</a></li></ul>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="13" id="mwAQc" aria-labelledby="Notes"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Notes">Notes</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Proportionality_(law)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13" title="Edit section: Notes"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
